DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
14489::$$$message_0113_0000_0000$$$::As I try stopping by the Matou house on a whim, I make eye contact with Sakura who is looking around in front of the entrance.[lr]::
14490::$$$message_0113_0000_0001$$$::"Oh, Senpai. Did you have any business at our house?"[lr]::
14491::$$$message_0113_0000_0002$$$::"No, I just happened to pass by. What were you doing? Did you lose your house key or something?"::
14492::$$$message_0113_0001_0000$$$::"I-I'm fine, even I wouldn't lose it that often.[lr]::
14493::$$$message_0113_0001_0001$$$::Besides, even if I lose it, I can open the door on my own so this is no big deal."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
14494::$$$message_0113_0002_0000$$$::Oh, the Matou house set up a self-locking door.[lr]::
14495::$$$message_0113_0002_0001$$$::It must be a thing called a magecraft lock, which is the same as the one at Tohsaka's.[lr]::
14496::$$$message_0113_0002_0002$$$::It's been getting dangerous out again, so that is fantastic but...::
14497::$$$message_0113_0003_0000$$$::"Hey. What is Shinji going to do about that?"[lr]::
14498::$$$message_0113_0003_0001$$$::"Shinji has his own keys. For the door, the living room, the bathroom, and his own room."[lr]::
14499::$$$message_0113_0003_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
14500::$$$message_0113_0003_0003$$$::To sum it up, if Shinji loses his keys, then he'll end up in the streets.::
14501::$$$message_0113_0004_0000$$$::It seems like there are locks on all the doors in the mansion. What a strict way to run a household.[lr]::
14502::$$$message_0113_0004_0001$$$::Also, I probably wouldn't be able to go inside either.[lr]::
14503::$$$message_0113_0004_0002$$$::When I go hang out at the Matou house, I need to make sure I don't get separated from Sakura.::
14504::$$$message_0113_0005_0000$$$::"...Oh, so that's why Shinji's keyholder has looked like a jailer's recently. So, what are you doing at the door if you didn't lose your key and don't even need one?"::
14505::$$$message_0113_0006_0000$$$::"Umm... My grandfather told me to wait at the door since we'll have a visitor.[lr]::
14506::$$$message_0113_0006_0001$$$::Apparently it's a visitor coming from afar, and although he wants to send them back, he has to welcome them due to his position."::
14507::$$$message_0113_0007_0000$$$::"...Sounds complicated. Is it Grandpa Zouken's visitor?"[lr]::
14508::$$$message_0113_0007_0001$$$::"Apparently it's a visitor who would originally come to Nee-san's place. But since Nee-san is gone, they said they'll come greet my grandfather as a substitute."::
14509::$$$message_0113_0008_0000$$$::I see. So it must be someone from the Mage's Association or the Church making their rounds.::
14510::$$$message_0113_0009_0000$$$::"Sorry for interrupting you. I'll go home before they pick a fight with me."[lr]::
14511::$$$message_0113_0009_0001$$$::"That will be helpful. Nee-san often says that you can't be seen by the people from the Mage's Association or the Church. She says that you're a protected animal or something."[lr]::
14512::$$$message_0113_0009_0002$$$::I want to denounce her next time, asking her who's the one who is abusing that protected animal.::
14513::$$$message_0113_0010_0000$$$::"All right, I'm gonna head home first then. Call me if you'll get home late. I'll come pick you up."[lr]::
14514::$$$message_0113_0010_0001$$$::"Okay, I will be sure to call you."[lr]::
14515::$$$message_0113_0010_0002$$$::I wave and leave the Matou house.[lr]::
14516::$$$message_0113_0010_0003$$$::...It's just my curious spirit, but maybe I'll ask just a bit more about them.::
14517::$$$message_0113_0011_0000$$$::"Hey, Sakura. What kind of person is that visitor?"[lr]::
14518::$$$message_0113_0011_0001$$$::"Ummm, I heard that they are the new overseer that was dispatched.[lr]::
14519::$$$message_0113_0011_0002$$$::My grandfather said that once they receive the official letter of appointment, they might move here as the acting prelate."[lr]::
14520::$$$message_0113_0011_0003$$$::So that means old Dielo would go back to his home country.[lr]::
14521::$$$message_0113_0011_0004$$$::Well, it's weird to think that someone who is a bishop as their main occupation would take up a new post at a church in a regional city, so that must be why a priest, who's better suited for a regional city, is coming.::
14522::$$$message_0113_0012_0000$$$::"Sakura, aren't you sad that the old man is going away? He's been treating you well."[lr]::
14523::$$$message_0113_0012_0001$$$::"Yes. But, I did know that he was only there for the time being until the successor was decided on."[lr]::
14524::$$$message_0113_0012_0002$$$::I see. Old Dielo was someone who originally came for the post-survey of the Holy Grail War. He must not stay for long without any special reason.::
14525::$$$message_0113_0013_0000$$$::My intellectual curiosity is satisfied.[lr]::
14526::$$$message_0113_0013_0001$$$::So, I actually leave the Matou house this time.[lr]::
14527::$$$message_0113_0013_0002$$$::[line len=3]After that...[lr]::
14528::$$$message_0113_0013_0003$$$::The visitor never came after all, and Sakura was waiting in vain for half a day.::
914517::$$$message_9113_0011_0000$$$::"Hey, Sakura. What kind of person is that visitor?"[r]::

